### Test Authentication Module - Simplified Auth Flow
### This file tests the simplified authentication endpoints

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/v1
@adminToken = YOUR_ADMIN_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
@preRegistrationToken = YOUR_PRE_REGISTRATION_TOKEN_HERE
@activeUserToken = YOUR_ACTIVE_USER_TOKEN_HERE

### 1. Register a new user (Admin only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "email": "nuevo.usuario@est.una.ac.cr",
  "fullName": "Usuario",
  "fullLastName": "De Prueba",
  "googleId": null,
  "photoUrl": null
}

### 2. Complete profile (User with PRE_REGISTRATION status)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/complete-profile
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{preRegistrationToken}}

{
  "fullName": "Juan Carlos",
  "fullLastName": "Pérez González",
  "phoneNumber": "+506 8888-8888"
}

### 3. Test Google OAuth flow (Visit in browser)
# GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/google/login

### 4. Test role selection (User must be ACTIVE)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/select-role
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{activeUserToken}}

{
  "roleId": "ROLE_ID_HERE"
}

### 5. Test get current user profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{activeUserToken}}

### 6. Test token refresh
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh
# Note: Refresh token is automatically sent via httpOnly cookie

### 7. Test logout
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout

### 8. Test unauthorized access to admin endpoints (should fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "unauthorized@est.una.ac.cr",
  "fullName": "Usuario",
  "fullLastName": "No Autorizado"
}
